    "metadata": {
     "agent": "halden-support",
     "max_steps": 6
    },
    "input": {
     "question": "My Halden e-bike battery barely lasts 20 km now. I bought it about 18 months ago. Is it still under warranty, and how long would a replacement take?"
    },
    "output": {
     "answer": "Yes, your battery is still under warranty. Halden e-bike batteries are covered for 24 months from the date of delivery, and order HB-20391 was delivered on 2025-05-12. If a service centre measures less than 70 percent of rated capacity, the battery is replaced free of charge. After approval, a replacement ships within 5 business days. To start, open a claim from the Orders page with your order number and the frame serial number."
    },
    "scores": [
